    "title": "Racers to Host Memphis in Midweek Match - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charlie Williams ,\n1 days ago The Murray State Racers will play host to the Memphis Tigers for a Wednesday morning match at 9:00 a.m. CT at the Pat Spurgin Rifle Range in Murray, Kentucky. Currently, the Racers are ranked 11th in the CRCA poll while the Tigers come in two spots ahead in ninth. The Tigers' aggregate average of 4720.857 is ninth in the nation, while the Racers are tenth with an average of 4708.112. Memphis averages scores of 2345 in smallbore and 2375.857 in air rifle, while Murray State averages scores of 2336.556 and 2371.556. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
